items.TD_Storm_Tyrant_Monument.name = Storm Tyrant Monument
items.TD_Storm_Tyrant_Monument.description = The first tyrant begged the heavens for mercy. This one raised ten fingers and demanded their obedience. Obsidian robes shelter a heart of captive thunder; carved violet arcs preserve the moment the storm learned whom to hate. An original dark-side storm-caster homage. Cosmetic decoration.
items.TD_Captive_Storm_Holocron.name = Captive Storm Holocron
items.TD_Captive_Storm_Holocron.description = A pyramidal prison holds the storm's final lesson: mercy is a door that opens only once. Ten etched paths converge on a violet heart, recalling the fingers that taught thunder its cruelty. Its secrets remain a silent display. An original homage to Sith holocrons; decorative light only.
items.TD_Seat_Of_Dominion.name = Throne of Black Dominion
items.TD_Seat_Of_Dominion.description = No surrendered name was ever spoken from this throne. Blackened ribs rise around the place where a sovereign commanded the heavens, and violet seams keep the debt of every storm that answered. An original dark-side command-throne homage. Interact to sit; no combat bonus.
